*: You know all this <span class="plainlinks">[http://www.hecklerspray.com/jordan-peter-andre-blah-blah-blah-blah-blah/200934040.php kerfuffle about Jordan and Peter Andre]</span>, and how you don’t know if they’re really splitting up or it’s just an act, and how you can’t be bothered to find out because wasting even a fraction of your brainpower on those bright orange clueless dicksplats would make you just as bad as them and you’d feel duty-bound to fling yourself under an industrial threshing machine as '''penance'''? You do? Good.

